What:           /sys/devices/platform/10000000.clock-controller/emi_state
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        FuQuan233
Description:
                Read-only owned EMI DCM policy, masked readback validity,
                probe/application count and late resume-repair count.
                Reports initial/current TOPCKGEN+0x0c and EMI_CONH+0x38.
                A valid policy is not an instantaneous output clock or
                electrical power measurement. Early pause/restore counters
                are in the existing MT6580 SPM state attribute.

What:           /sys/devices/platform/10208000.clock-controller/dcm_state
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        FuQuan233
Description:
                Read-only inherited DRAMC AO PD_CTRL policy. owned=0 and
                source=firmware indicate that this driver does not write it.
                valid compares bits31/30/25 against the probe snapshot;
                checks/failures count system resume policy comparisons.
                Also reports initial/current words and the three enables.
